[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16140.429, "timestamp": "04:29:00", "text": "因为我现在终于有了电路板，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16144.07, "timestamp": "04:29:04", "text": "一切。是的，我很好。无法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16145.07, "timestamp": "04:29:05", "text": "做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16147.67, "timestamp": "04:29:07", "text": "万圣节。我也没能过万圣节。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16150.07, "timestamp": "04:29:10", "text": "我并没有庆祝，但我确实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16153.189, "timestamp": "04:29:13", "text": "今年能和大家一起庆祝真是太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16155.99, "timestamp": "04:29:15", "text": "没错，你是在玩恐怖游戏。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16159.75, "timestamp": "04:29:19", "text": "我不知道今天要做什么。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16161.95, "timestamp": "04:29:21", "text": "我以为我只是在做一件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16164.55, "timestamp": "04:29:24", "text": "聊天。当然，我想做一件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16167.75, "timestamp": "04:29:27", "text": "恐怖游戏之类的，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16169.07, "timestamp": "04:29:29", "text": "感觉就像，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16173.189, "timestamp": "04:29:33", "text": "我知道，我感觉自己就像啊，那位阿姨，那位"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16176.149, "timestamp": "04:29:36", "text": "房东阿姨在那儿过夜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16178.63, "timestamp": "04:29:38", "text": "我不想吓到她。我确实想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16181.349, "timestamp": "04:29:41", "text": "今年想玩恐怖游戏吗？分享一下你的梦想吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16185.03, "timestamp": "04:29:45", "text": "不，我其实没怎么拍恐怖片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16188.63, "timestamp": "04:29:48", "text": "我仍然不善良，是的，善良"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16189.79, "timestamp": "04:29:49", "text": "的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16192.389, "timestamp": "04:29:52", "text": "后悔。你觉得我拍过恐怖片吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16193.79, "timestamp": "04:29:53", "text": "流？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16197.349, "timestamp": "04:29:57", "text": "米娜，我确实参与过合作直播。喜欢，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16199.63, "timestamp